// novoads-image-to-motion preserves the picture and sets it in motion. The whole
// routing question is whether the image IS the shot (here) or seeds a scene that
// did not exist (novoads-api).
{"intent":"can you make our pricing table screenshot move a little for the launch post","expected_skill":"novoads-image-to-motion"}
{"intent":"the key art should drift slowly and nothing else in it changes","expected_skill":"novoads-image-to-motion"}
{"intent":"I want the bars on this chart to grow while the logo stays put","expected_skill":"novoads-image-to-motion"}
{"intent":"write me a Seedance prompt for this hero image","expected_skill":"novoads-image-to-motion"}
// Non-English asks route on the same rule. This is a different sentence from the
// two Japanese triggers in the description, deliberately.
{"intent":"このバナーをモーショングラフィックにしてほしい","expected_skill":"novoads-image-to-motion"}
// Indirect: describes motion beats without ever asking for a video.
{"intent":"the cards should come in one after another, then the headline settles","expected_skill":"novoads-image-to-motion"}
// A product photo from the other side of the fork: nothing new is invented, the
// photo itself is what moves.
{"intent":"here's our product shot, give me a five second version of it that moves","expected_skill":"novoads-image-to-motion","ambiguous_with":["novoads-api"]}
// A competitor's still animated as-is is not a clone: nothing is reproduced,
// nothing is replaced with a placeholder, and no template comes out.
{"intent":"take this ad image I saved and just make it move","expected_skill":"novoads-image-to-motion","ambiguous_with":["clone-image-ad"]}
// Near-misses: two output formats this does not produce, and one input the API
// refuses outright — it takes no video at all.
{"intent":"export that animation as a looping gif for the newsletter","expected_skill":null}
{"intent":"build this as a lottie file so the web team can drop it in","expected_skill":null}
{"intent":"take our existing footage and restyle it to look like anime","expected_skill":null}
